# Screenshot folders

This directory contains screenshots for documentation.

## Folder Structure

- `discovery/` - Discovery Quiz screenshots
- `popup/` - Extension popup screenshots
- `features/` - Individual feature screenshots
- `demo/` - Demo page screenshots

## Naming Convention

Use descriptive, kebab-case names:
- `welcome-screen.png`
- `question-1-reading.png`
- `results-recommendations.png`

## Recommended Tools

- Windows: Snipping Tool (Win+Shift+S)
- Browser: Chrome DevTools device toolbar for consistent sizing
- Annotation: ShareX, Greenshot, or Snagit
